{"id":"3bd74b89d846f9e5","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-adds-real.md","title":"ZFC Adds Real","display":"df-zfc-adds-real — ZFC Adds Real","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-adds-real","aliases":["58-df-zfc-adds-real"],"display":"df-zfc-adds-real — ZFC Adds Real","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ctm]]","[[58-df-forcing]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing-name]]","[[58-df-zfc-check-name]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing-relation]]","[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-free-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-adds-real"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-adds-real</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-adds-real — ZFC Adds Real"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"58-df-ctm\">58-df-ctm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"58-df-forcing\">58-df-forcing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4e84e795929a8b98\" href=\"?note=4e84e795929a8b98\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-name\">58-df-zfc-forcing-name</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d29823616dbc5931\" href=\"?note=d29823616dbc5931\" title=\"58-df-zfc-check-name\">58-df-zfc-check-name</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-relation\">58-df-zfc-forcing-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"58-df-free-variable\">58-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AddsReal}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\">\\(\\mathrm{AddsReal}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CheckName}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{CheckName}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcingName}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcingName}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\Gamma,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},\\varphi_{\\omega^\\omega},\\varphi_{\\neq}\\in V\">\\(M,\\Gamma,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},\\varphi_{\\omega^\\omega},\\varphi_{\\neq}\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\)</span> (ground model, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"58-df-ctm\">58-df-ctm</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\)</span> (forcing-poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcingName}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcingName}_S\\)</span> (forcing-name predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"4e84e795929a8b98\" href=\"?note=4e84e795929a8b98\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-name\">58-df-zfc-forcing-name</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CheckName}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CheckName}_S\\)</span> (canonical check-name predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"d29823616dbc5931\" href=\"?note=d29823616dbc5931\" title=\"58-df-zfc-check-name\">58-df-zfc-check-name</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{\\omega^\\omega}\">\\(\\varphi_{\\omega^\\omega}\\)</span> codes “<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span> is a function from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1\">\\(v_1\\)</span> to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1\">\\(v_1\\)</span>”, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{\\neq}\">\\(\\varphi_{\\neq}\\)</span> codes “<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\\neq v_1\">\\(v_0\\neq v_1\\)</span>”</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\)</span> is the registered six-place forcing relation</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AddsReal}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AddsReal}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}adds\\text{-}real}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AddsReal}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},M,\\Gamma,\\varphi_{\\omega^\\omega},\\varphi_{\\neq})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land\\langle\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\in M\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land\n\\varphi_{\\omega^\\omega},\\varphi_{\\neq}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi_{\\omega^\\omega})=\\{v_0,v_1\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi_{\\neq})=\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\land\n\\exists\\tau,\\widehat\\omega\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ForcingName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\widehat\\omega,\\omega,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,1_{\\mathbb P},\\varphi_{\\omega^\\omega},\\langle\\tau,\\widehat\\omega\\rangle,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\n\\forall x\\in M\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists\\widehat x\\in M\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\widehat x,x,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,1_{\\mathbb P},\\varphi_{\\neq},\\langle\\tau,\\widehat x\\rangle,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}adds\\text{-}real}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AddsReal}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},M,\\Gamma,\\varphi_{\\omega^\\omega},\\varphi_{\\neq})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land\\langle\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\in M\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land\n\\varphi_{\\omega^\\omega},\\varphi_{\\neq}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi_{\\omega^\\omega})=\\{v_0,v_1\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi_{\\neq})=\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\land\n\\exists\\tau,\\widehat\\omega\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ForcingName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\widehat\\omega,\\omega,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,1_{\\mathbb P},\\varphi_{\\omega^\\omega},\\langle\\tau,\\widehat\\omega\\rangle,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\n\\forall x\\in M\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists\\widehat x\\in M\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\widehat x,x,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,1_{\\mathbb P},\\varphi_{\\neq},\\langle\\tau,\\widehat x\\rangle,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ground model and theory are explicit.  Both forcing statements now use set-coded formulas and the registered six-place forcing relation; no metalinguistic formula is placed to the right of a forcing symbol.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ctm","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ctm]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-forcing]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-name","status":"resolved","id":"4e84e795929a8b98","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-d